{"_id":"6925a7ff7c7d1fa20e7693e4","roadmapSlug":"elasticsearch","nodeId":"q8SWm-tJ9c7uIY6wxzQdI","description":"# Value Count Aggregation\n\nValue Count is a type of metric aggregation that calculates the total number of values present in a specific field. It essentially counts how many documents have a value for the chosen field, including duplicates if they exist. This aggregation is useful for determining the overall occurrence or frequency of a particular field within your dataset.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"Aggregations","url":"https://www.elastic.co/docs/explore-analyze/query-filter/aggregations","_id":"69284397467651eddb61afc4"},{"type":"official","title":"Count search results","url":"https://www.elastic.co/docs/api/doc/elasticsearch/operation/operation-count","_id":"69284397467651eddb61afc5"},{"type":"official","title":"Value count aggregation","url":"https://www.elastic.co/docs/reference/aggregations/search-aggregations-metrics-valuecount-aggregation","_id":"69284397467651eddb61afc6"},{"type":"article","title":"Elasticsearch Value Count Aggregation - Syntax, Example, and Tips","url":"https://pulse.support/kb/elasticsearch-value-count-aggregation","_id":"69284397467651eddb61afc7"},{"type":"video","title":"Elasticsearch Aggregations & go-elasticsearch - Elastic Meetup","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y5MUNPJzMsI","_id":"69284397467651eddb61afc8"}],"createdAt":"2025-11-25T12:58:39.198Z","updatedAt":"2025-11-27T12:27:03.094Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/elasticsearch/content/q8SWm-tJ9c7uIY6wxzQdI.md"}